# Local credential scratch. `details.md` held a live till token, an owner login and
# the platform super-admin password — a `git add -A` away from being published to a
# branch and living in history forever. Ignored so that cannot happen by accident;
# real secrets belong in a password manager, not the working tree.
details.md
